## Project Purpose
This project is developed by Daniel Sukamto for hackathon participation and startup development purposes. It demonstrates a complete Web3 copyright verification and multi-token payment platform built on Base Layer-2 blockchain, showcasing advanced smart contract architecture and frontend integration.

